{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/extras/allahmmmmyaa.png?t=1740826063\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/extras/who_infected_giff.gif?t=1740826063\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/extras/Dismemberment.png?t=1740826063\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/extras/dismemberment_gif.gif?t=1740826063\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/extras/broke_leg_and_arm.png?t=1740826063\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/extras/bu_broke_leg.gif?t=1740826063\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Creator:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>My girlfriend and I dropped out of university to start developing games. She handles the designs, while I take care of the programming.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To support us, please add to your Wishlist now :))</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/extras/GIF_Wishlist.gif?t=1740826063\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Can You Survive in a World Without Trust?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a <strong>1-8 player Multiplayer co-op party</strong> game with <strong>Active Ragdoll</strong> mechanics and physics-based interactions! In a post-apocalyptic world devastated by a zombie outbreak, you\u2019ll soon realize that your biggest enemy isn\u2019t just the zombies:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Doubt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every player starts as a human. Your mission is simple: <strong>Survive</strong>, gather supplies, and establish a safe zone with your team. But as time passes, the <strong>infection spreads silently</strong>, and even your closest friend might be hiding a secret...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When infected, a player <strong>loses control of their actions</strong> and starts attacking teammates unwillingly. You never know <strong>when, where, or who</strong> will be infected next. The scariest part? <strong>The longer an infected player hides their condition, the stronger a zombie they become!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Who Can You Trust?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay human, <strong>cooperate with your team</strong>, recruit NPCs to your group, or loot them for resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If infected, <strong>conceal your identity</strong>, evolve into a stronger zombie, and sabotage your team from within.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Arm Yourself, Use Your Wits, and Fight to Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From melee weapons to ranged firearms, <strong>a variety of combat options await you.</strong> Manage your resources wisely, take down enemies, and prove yourself as the <strong>strongest survivor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match lasts <strong>40-45 minutes</strong>, but your choices will determine its outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you trust your best friend? What if they\u2019ve been infected and are keeping it a secret? What will you do?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439260?t=1740826063","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740826063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439260/74c1eab8e